Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,140] | Elapsed:  14.35s | Words: 9  | Text: 男人走向破产三件套
Segment #2   [00:00:02,140 --> 00:00:03,120] | Elapsed:  14.35s | Words: 3  | Text: 第一 酒精
Segment #3   [00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:04,440] | Elapsed:  14.35s | Words: 3  | Text: 第二 女人
Segment #4   [00:00:04,440 --> 00:00:05,460] | Elapsed:  14.35s | Words: 3  | Text: 第三 杠杆
Segment #5   [00:00:05,460 --> 00:00:08,020] | Elapsed:  14.35s | Words: 13 | Text: 我喝酒这一块应该没有出过大问题
Segment #6   [00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:09,960] | Elapsed:  14.35s | Words: 7  | Text: 然后我在女人这一块
Segment #7   [00:00:09,960 --> 00:00:11,600] | Elapsed:  14.35s | Words: 6  | Text: 我也没有出过大问题
Segment #8   [00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:12,760] | Elapsed:  14.35s | Words: 3  | Text: 就是我的心
Segment #9   [00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:15,140] | Elapsed:  14.35s | Words: 10 | Text: 我在大容发杀了十年的鱼了
Segment #10  [00:00:15,140 --> 00:00:17,760] | Elapsed:  14.35s | Words: 11 | Text: 我的心已经比那个刀还要冰冷了
Segment #11  [00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:20,120] | Elapsed:  14.35s | Words: 13 | Text: 我们这种人永远不可能会为情所困
Segment #12  [00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:21,840] | Elapsed:  14.35s | Words: 9  | Text: 在历史中有很多的男人
Segment #13  [00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:23,120] | Elapsed:  14.35s | Words: 5  | Text: 江山怎么丢的
Segment #14  [00:00:23,120 --> 00:00:24,440] | Elapsed:  14.35s | Words: 8  | Text: 兄弟们 江山怎么丢的
Segment #15  [00:00:24,440 --> 00:00:25,240] | Elapsed:  14.35s | Words: 4  | Text: 为了女人
Segment #16  [00:00:25,240 --> 00:00:26,560] | Elapsed:  14.35s | Words: 6  | Text: 但是我在女人身上
Segment #17  [00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:28,020] | Elapsed:  14.35s | Words: 8  | Text: 我真的没有犯过任何错
Segment #18  [00:00:28,020 --> 00:00:28,900] | Elapsed:  14.35s | Words: 4  | Text: 因为我很清醒
Segment #19  [00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:29,780] | Elapsed:  32.60s | Words: 4  | Text: 但是我唯独
Segment #20  [00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:31,080] | Elapsed:  32.60s | Words: 6  | Text: 第三点我就没做的
Segment #21  [00:00:31,080 --> 00:00:32,380] | Elapsed:  32.60s | Words: 5  | Text: 第三点叫杠杆
Segment #22  [00:00:32,380 --> 00:00:34,420] | Elapsed:  32.60s | Words: 8  | Text: 我给大家举一个最简单
Segment #23  [00:00:34,420 --> 00:00:35,600] | Elapsed:  32.60s | Words: 6  | Text: 最简单的例子
Segment #24  [00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:36,260] | Elapsed:  32.60s | Words: 4  | Text: 就叫杠杆
Segment #25  [00:00:36,260 --> 00:00:37,640] | Elapsed:  32.60s | Words: 6  | Text: 李嘉诚大家都知道吧
Segment #26  [00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:39,180] | Elapsed:  32.60s | Words: 8  | Text: 李嘉诚在最早去香港
Segment #27  [00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:40,380] | Elapsed:  32.60s | Words: 6  | Text: 在卖塑料花开始
Segment #28  [00:00:40,380 --> 00:00:41,560] | Elapsed:  32.60s | Words: 7  | Text: 后来做了房地产
Segment #29  [00:00:41,560 --> 00:00:43,740] | Elapsed:  32.60s | Words: 9  | Text: 从一个塑料花厂的老板
Segment #30  [00:00:43,740 --> 00:00:45,340] | Elapsed:  32.60s | Words: 7  | Text: 转型做了房地产
Segment #31  [00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:46,400] | Elapsed:  32.60s | Words: 6  | Text: 他家不家杠杆
Segment #32  [00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:47,480] | Elapsed:  32.60s | Words: 6  | Text: 老天没回答我
Segment #33  [00:00:47,480 --> 00:00:48,540] | Elapsed:  32.60s | Words: 7  | Text: 你们没回答家不家
Segment #34  [00:00:48,540 --> 00:00:50,780] | Elapsed:  32.60s | Words: 10 | Text: 比如说他拿一个亿去炒地皮
Segment #35  [00:00:50,780 --> 00:00:52,240] | Elapsed:  32.60s | Words: 7  | Text: 这一个亿是怎么来的
Segment #36  [00:00:52,240 --> 00:00:53,520] | Elapsed:  32.60s | Words: 6  | Text: 他可能他只有500万
Segment #37  [00:00:53,520 --> 00:00:55,400] | Elapsed:  32.60s | Words: 9  | Text: 他的月付又给了他2000万
Segment #38  [00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:56,540] | Elapsed:  32.60s | Words: 5  | Text: 他有2500万
Segment #39  [00:00:56,540 --> 00:00:58,480] | Elapsed:  32.60s | Words: 10 | Text: 可能拿着2500万去做猎后
Segment #40  [00:00:58,480 --> 00:00:59,240] | Elapsed:  52.35s | Words: 4  | Text: 什么叫猎后
Segment #41  [00:00:59,240 --> 00:01:00,040] | Elapsed:  52.35s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是2500万
Segment #42  [00:01:00,040 --> 00:01:01,040] | Elapsed:  52.35s | Words: 7  | Text: 我去融别人的钱
Segment #43  [00:01:01,040 --> 00:01:01,760] | Elapsed:  52.35s | Words: 4  | Text: 亏了先思
Segment #44  [00:01:01,760 --> 00:01:03,180] | Elapsed:  52.35s | Words: 9  | Text: 先从我这2500万里扣
Segment #45  [00:01:03,180 --> 00:01:04,240] | Elapsed:  52.35s | Words: 5  | Text: 你随时撤资
Segment #46  [00:01:04,240 --> 00:01:05,320] | Elapsed:  52.35s | Words: 4  | Text: 你的钱不会少
Segment #47  [00:01:05,320 --> 00:01:06,940] | Elapsed:  52.35s | Words: 6  | Text: 他一定是2500万
Segment #48  [00:01:06,940 --> 00:01:08,000] | Elapsed:  52.35s | Words: 6  | Text: 又融了7500万
Segment #49  [00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:09,460] | Elapsed:  52.35s | Words: 10 | Text: 拿了这一个亿去炒的地皮
Segment #50  [00:01:09,460 --> 00:01:11,440] | Elapsed:  52.35s | Words: 7  | Text: 但是他杠杆夹对了
Segment #51  [00:01:11,440 --> 00:01:13,360] | Elapsed:  52.35s | Words: 9  | Text: 但是我唯一我只做错了
Segment #52  [00:01:13,360 --> 00:01:14,600] | Elapsed:  52.35s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是我之前总给你们
Segment #53  [00:01:14,600 --> 00:01:15,940] | Elapsed:  52.35s | Words: 5  | Text: 分享的一个道理
Segment #54  [00:01:15,940 --> 00:01:16,820] | Elapsed:  52.35s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是只付一次
Segment #55  [00:01:16,820 --> 00:01:18,060] | Elapsed:  52.35s | Words: 6  | Text: 只付一次表达的
Segment #56  [00:01:18,060 --> 00:01:19,260] | Elapsed:  52.35s | Words: 8  | Text: 核心逻辑关联是什么
Segment #57  [00:01:19,260 --> 00:01:20,960] | Elapsed:  52.35s | Words: 7  | Text: 比如说我们现在有钱了
Segment #58  [00:01:20,960 --> 00:01:22,280] | Elapsed:  52.35s | Words: 5  | Text: 我们现在有5000万
Segment #59  [00:01:22,280 --> 00:01:23,000] | Elapsed:  52.35s | Words: 4  | Text: 我们最重要的
Segment #60  [00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:24,520] | Elapsed:  52.35s | Words: 9  | Text: 不是让这5000万到5个亿
Segment #61  [00:01:24,520 --> 00:01:25,080] | Elapsed:  52.35s | Words: 2  | Text: 到不了
Segment #62  [00:01:25,080 --> 00:01:26,340] | Elapsed:  52.35s | Words: 7  | Text: 咱都不说5000万了
Segment #63  [00:01:26,340 --> 00:01:28,000] | Elapsed:  52.35s | Words: 9  | Text: 3000万在那地过得很好了
Segment #64  [00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:29,280] | Elapsed:  70.33s | Words: 7  | Text: 买个1000万的房子
Segment #65  [00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:31,260] | Elapsed:  70.33s | Words: 7  | Text: 在林仪是人上人
Segment #66  [00:01:31,260 --> 00:01:33,340] | Elapsed:  70.33s | Words: 10 | Text: 买辆300万的车很牛逼了
Segment #67  [00:01:33,340 --> 00:01:35,200] | Elapsed:  70.33s | Words: 10 | Text: 都得留个一两千万块钱
Segment #68  [00:01:35,200 --> 00:01:36,320] | Elapsed:  70.33s | Words: 4  | Text: 花不完的
Segment #69  [00:01:36,320 --> 00:01:38,040] | Elapsed:  70.33s | Words: 10 | Text: 你为什么你要还想着到3个亿
Segment #70  [00:01:38,040 --> 00:01:39,940] | Elapsed:  70.33s | Words: 10 | Text: 3000万的生活和3个亿的生活
Segment #71  [00:01:39,940 --> 00:01:41,040] | Elapsed:  70.33s | Words: 8  | Text: 它有任何的区别吗
Segment #72  [00:01:41,040 --> 00:01:42,020] | Elapsed:  70.33s | Words: 4  | Text: 你为什么要像
Segment #73  [00:01:42,020 --> 00:01:43,280] | Elapsed:  70.33s | Words: 6  | Text: 一个不懂事的孩子
Segment #74  [00:01:43,280 --> 00:01:44,380] | Elapsed:  70.33s | Words: 6  | Text: 去堆积木一样
Segment #75  [00:01:44,380 --> 00:01:44,960] | Elapsed:  70.33s | Words: 3  | Text: 到了这么高
Segment #76  [00:01:44,960 --> 00:01:45,560] | Elapsed:  70.33s | Words: 3  | Text: 想这么高
Segment #77  [00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:46,140] | Elapsed:  70.33s | Words: 3  | Text: 到了这么高
Segment #78  [00:01:46,140 --> 00:01:46,680] | Elapsed:  70.33s | Words: 3  | Text: 想这么高
Segment #79  [00:01:46,680 --> 00:01:47,280] | Elapsed:  70.33s | Words: 3  | Text: 你知不知道
Segment #80  [00:01:47,280 --> 00:01:47,980] | Elapsed:  70.33s | Words: 4  | Text: 早晚有一天
Segment #81  [00:01:47,980 --> 00:01:49,400] | Elapsed:  70.33s | Words: 6  | Text: 这个积木会塌的
Segment #82  [00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:50,560] | Elapsed:  70.33s | Words: 6  | Text: 以前我就在想这个问题
Segment #83  [00:01:50,560 --> 00:01:52,480] | Elapsed:  70.33s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是我最难的时候
Segment #84  [00:01:52,480 --> 00:01:53,380] | Elapsed:  70.33s | Words: 7  | Text: 我都不怕你们笑我
Segment #85  [00:01:53,380 --> 00:01:54,660] | Elapsed:  70.33s | Words: 6  | Text: 我自己人在房间
Segment #86  [00:01:54,660 --> 00:01:55,780] | Elapsed:  70.33s | Words: 7  | Text: 我自己打我自己嘴巴
Segment #87  [00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:58,600] | Elapsed:  85.53s | Words: 6  | Text: 边打边掉眼泪
Segment #88  [00:01:58,600 --> 00:01:59,560] | Elapsed:  85.53s | Words: 4  | Text: 边打边哭
Segment #89  [00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:00,560] | Elapsed:  85.53s | Words: 5  | Text: 这豪桃大哭
Segment #90  [00:02:00,560 --> 00:02:02,300] | Elapsed:  85.53s | Words: 4  | Text: 我就恨我自己
Segment #91  [00:02:02,300 --> 00:02:03,100] | Elapsed:  85.53s | Words: 4  | Text: 我就恨我自己
Segment #92  [00:02:03,100 --> 00:02:05,440] | Elapsed:  85.53s | Words: 8  | Text: 为什么要去选择加杠杆
Segment #93  [00:02:05,440 --> 00:02:07,020] | Elapsed:  85.53s | Words: 5  | Text: 为什么不珍惜自己
Segment #94  [00:02:07,020 --> 00:02:08,020] | Elapsed:  85.53s | Words: 4  | Text: 现有的生活
Segment #95  [00:02:08,020 --> 00:02:09,460] | Elapsed:  85.53s | Words: 6  | Text: 为什么要在一瞬间
Segment #96  [00:02:09,460 --> 00:02:11,180] | Elapsed:  85.53s | Words: 10 | Text: 把所有曾经拥有过的一切
Segment #97  [00:02:11,180 --> 00:02:12,260] | Elapsed:  85.53s | Words: 4  | Text: 化为无尽
Segment #98  [00:02:12,260 --> 00:02:13,240] | Elapsed:  85.53s | Words: 4  | Text: 烟消云散
Segment #99  [00:02:14,060 --> 00:02:15,840] | Elapsed:  85.53s | Words: 7  | Text: 我需要用更多的钱
Segment #100 [00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:17,660] | Elapsed:  85.53s | Words: 7  | Text: 来让我自己一直活下去
Segment #101 [00:02:17,660 --> 00:02:19,220] | Elapsed:  85.53s | Words: 8  | Text: 所以说我不得不加杠杆
Segment #102 [00:02:19,220 --> 00:02:20,300] | Elapsed:  85.53s | Words: 5  | Text: 因为我不加杠杆
Segment #103 [00:02:20,300 --> 00:02:20,960] | Elapsed:  85.53s | Words: 2  | Text: 也是死
Segment #104 [00:02:20,960 --> 00:02:22,120] | Elapsed:  85.53s | Words: 6  | Text: 加了杠杆也是死
